  "title": "UAE and US launch military strikes on Strait of Hormuz amid regional tensions",
  "summary": "The UAE and US launched military strikes on the Strait of Hormuz, with the US imposing a 20% fee on cargo shipping, while Iran retaliated with attacks on tankers and military facilities. These actions intensified global tensions over control of the region.",
